&lt;span style="line-height:1.5;"&gt;Adam spotted this &lt;a href="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Beechcraft_Starship"&gt;Beech Starship&lt;/a&gt;. They were a disaster for the airplane manufacturer and we had no idea any were left flying. The incarnation I like is the &lt;a href="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Piaggio_P.180_Avanti"&gt;Piaggio&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;</content:encoded>
